OL,3,AIndonesia volcano eruption leaves
OL,4,A340,000 stranded as airports extend
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FJakarta's Soekarno-Hatta International
OL,8,Fairport decided not to reopen at 18:00
OL,9,F(11:00 GMT) as planned due to the
OL,10,Fcontinued presence of volcanic ash near
OL,11,Fits airspace.
OL,13,FFlights will instead resume at 23:59 on
OL,14,FMonday, the airport has said in a
OL,15,Fstatement.
